png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Amy's 低鹽低脂蔬菜湯 熱量：47.5kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e9f7968f25dba55dce7d933c51fc73d/2024-08/100_7.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1罐 Amy's 低鹽低脂蔬菜湯=3份蔬菜+1份脂肪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a123a296c970ad6769f63e9427892bd/2024-08/101_0_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"較低脂栗米湯\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c82ef082c31334cffe7d1e4c0a80134/2024-08/102_8.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶金黃栗米湯 熱量：67kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97f7c08ea835af394af523f0d34358db/2024-08/103_0_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/3罐金寶金黃栗米湯=1份五穀類\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60612280806f4812652368b061f22c71/2024-08/104_9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶火腿栗米湯 熱量：66kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ec6b2be8e873b5548000a8ea6834599/2024-08/105_10.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/2罐金寶火腿栗米湯=1份五穀類+1份脂肪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e65cdc3b19bb3b7c69748cef9a8f42a/2024-08/106_10.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶日式甜栗米湯 熱量：75kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ff0fbb9f9e022e0e9c4fab911fb7cfb/2024-08/107_10.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/2罐金寶日式甜栗米湯=1份五穀類+1份脂肪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56514113472ad9068ea92a384530504f/2024-08/108_9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶雞蘑蓉栗米湯 熱量：71kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1182e441121fa99db835fff12b6f873/2024-08/109_8.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/2罐金寶雞蘑蓉栗米湯=1份五穀類+1份脂肪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba3c30fafcbe77a9b6108b64d0581ac9/2024-08/110_7.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"較低脂其他湯品\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf410d8f9b889b28746afb6a2d6fd7c2/2024-08/111_8.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶日式忌廉南瓜湯 熱量：71kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d61a535f02884acc165869bcd67673f2/2024-08/112_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/3罐金寶日式忌廉南瓜湯=1份五穀類\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43031e4c4ff24ff23631719466f659a0/2024-08/113_5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"金寶蘑菇栗米湯 熱量：80kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c37199a44cd9e2266a8872968ea09c95/2024-08/114_9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"1/3罐金寶蘑菇栗米湯=1份五穀類+0.5份脂肪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc97ab9b87ee5bb70c6dba877ff6b5f6/2024-08/115_9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\" BAXTERS法式洋蔥湯 熱量：37kcal\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee20513a93ed4ccdebe91b7af7cddc41/2024-08/116_9.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c927986eac3acdfd6a02d71d2bd96044/2024-08/117_8.png\"/>\n<p>---</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T05:19:02.151672+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":621,"images":54,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}